project's analytical work or submitted competition materials.

Modifications: retain only x86/ARM architecture mappings and unprivileged
application rules; omit capability-dependent privileged rules, ptrace and
io_uring; add namespace-local chroot and modern unprivileged filesystem calls;
return ENOSYS for clone3 so libc can fall back to clone. The renderer runs with
all Linux capabilities dropped and no-new-privileges enabled. No host-level
mount, keyring, BPF, module-loading or tracing permission is granted.
